---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../consts';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="Who I am, what I write about, and why this site exists.">
	<div class="container narrow">
		<p class="eyebrow">About</p>
		<h1 class="page-title">Hi, I'm Sudin.</h1>
		<p class="page-lede">
			{/* TODO: rewrite this in your own words */}
			I train, I build things with code, and I like thinking out loud. This site is where those three meet.
		</p>

		<div class="prose body">
			<!-- ✏️ Everything below is starter copy. Replace it with your own story. -->
			<p>
				I started this site because I kept explaining the same things to friends: how I structure my training,
				which tools actually make me more productive, and what I've learned from the books and people around
				me. Writing it down once, properly, felt better than repeating it.
			</p>

			<h2>What you'll find here</h2>
			<ul>
				<li><strong><a href="/category/fitness/">Fitness</a></strong> — training logs, programming, nutrition, and the mindset side of staying consistent.</li>
				<li><strong><a href="/category/tech/">Tech</a></strong> — software I'm building, tools I use every day, and notes from learning new things.</li>
				<li><strong><a href="/category/life/">Life &amp; more</a></strong> — books, ideas, travel, and anything else worth talking about.</li>
			</ul>

			<h2>Right now</h2>
			<p>
				I'm currently focused on getting stronger, shipping side projects, and writing here regularly.
				If you want to say hello, the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> has the best ways to reach me.
			</p>
		</div>

		<aside class="card">
			<p>Prefer email?</p>
			<a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`} id="about-email">{SITE.email} <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
		</aside>
	</div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.body {
		margin-top: 2.5rem;
	}
	.card {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		justify-content: space-between;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.5rem 1.5rem;
		max-width: var(--measure);
		margin-top: 3rem;
		padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
		background: var(--surface);
		border-radius: var(--radius);
		box-shadow: var(--shadow);
	}
	.card p {
		margin: 0;
		color: var(--muted);
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}
	.card a {
		font-weight: 500;
		text-decoration: none;
	}
</style>
